message: "If you use this formalization, please cite it as below, and also cite the paper."
title: "Lean 4 formalization of 'A Note on Edge Colorings and Trees'"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Jarden
    given-names: Adi
repository-code: "https://github.com/jardenadi/edge-colorings-trees-lean"
license: Apache-2.0
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23964479
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-03
abstract: >-
  A formalization in Lean 4 and Mathlib of Sections 2-7 of the paper
  "A Note on Edge Colorings and Trees" by Adi Jarden and Ziv Shami
  (arXiv:2204.06874). All theorems are proved without sorry. The
  formalization was produced with an AI coding agent, with human review
  of every formal statement.
keywords:
  - Lean 4
  - Mathlib
  - formal verification
  - set theory
  - edge colorings
  - trees
